 bgslibrary  tools  
 
foregroundmaskanalysis  foregroundmaskanalysis     
  firsttime showoutput stopat 0   img ref path     
  
  debug construction foregroundmaskanalysis   
  initloadsaveconfig quote foregroundmaskanalysis    
  
 
foregroundmaskanalysis   foregroundmaskanalysis     
  debug destruction foregroundmaskanalysis foregroundmaskanalysis  process framenumber std  string  name cv  mat  img input img input empty stopat    framenumber    img ref path empty cv  mat img ref   cv  imread img ref path  0 showoutput  
      cv  imshow  foregroundmaskanalysis   img ref rn   cv  countnonzero img ref   
    cv  mat cv  mat u rn   0 img input   img ref  
      u   img input   img ref img input      img ref   
      u     img input      img ref cv  countnonzero un   cv  countnonzero u s un showoutput    
      cv  imshow b cv  imshow  avb   u   
      
 
    std  cout    name      - similarity measure       s      press enter std  endl  
 
    cv  waitkey 0   
    
 
  firsttime foregroundmaskanalysis  save config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs     stopat     stopat  
  fs     img ref path     img ref path foregroundmaskanalysis  load config cv  filestorage  fs    
  fs  stopat      stopat  
  fs  img ref path      img ref path  
   bgslibrary tools foregroundmaskanalysis